# CODEOWNERS
#
# One human owner today (@hughminhphan). The value of this file right now is the
# LANE MAP, not the routing: it is the machine-readable statement of which lane
# owns which paths, so two agents are never writers on the same file.
#
# Lanes (see docs/BACKLOG.md for the full ownership map and the task contract):
#   A  Simulator core          schematic editor, circuit schema, sim engine, waveforms
#   B  Designer                design and sourcing packages, the Designer web feature
#   C  Model content and tools model library, component schema, conveyor and factory
#   D  Docs, CI, hygiene       docs, workflows, scripts, root configuration
#
# Rules that matter more than the owner column:
#   - A task may only write files inside its own lane's globs.
#   - Shared files are single-owner: whoever holds the task edits them, alone.
#   - Frozen contracts are never edited by an agent. They are listed in
#     docs/BACKLOG.md and repeated at the bottom of this file.

